WEBVTT

00:03:28.618 --> 00:03:30.799
that are so important
to life on our planet.

00:03:30.823 --> 00:03:32.355
TZ: Exactly, Simone.

00:03:32.379 --> 00:03:33.926
So to do this,

00:03:33.950 --> 00:03:38.378
we're going to bring you
scuba diving with plankton.

00:03:39.013 --> 00:03:42.641
But I just need to shrink you
by a factor of 1000,

00:03:42.665 --> 00:03:47.110
to a scale where the diameter
of a human hair is as big as my hand.

00:03:47.657 --> 00:03:50.815
And I happen to have invented
a machine to do just that.

00:03:51.292 --> 00:03:54.609
SB: Anyone here remember
"Fantastic Voyage"

00:03:54.633 --> 00:03:56.029
or "Innerspace?"

00:03:56.387 --> 00:03:57.538
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:57.562 --> 00:04:01.426
Martin Short is one of my all-time
favorite actors.